date-released: 2026-08-10
keywords:
  - IEC 61850
  - Sampled Values
  - protection relay
  - virtual relay test set
  - closed-loop secondary injection
  - metrology timing
  - automatic voltage regulator
  - OLTC
  - transformer differential
  - restricted earth fault
  - secondary injection
  - process bus
  - power systems
  - virtual laboratory
abstract: >-
  ARVREL is a vendor-neutral Windows virtual protection and control IED laboratory for
  IEC 61850 engineering, Sampled Values analysis, closed-loop feeder secondary injection
  with external virtual-I/O timing, virtual feeder and transformer protection, AVR/OLTC
  simulation, synchronized two-sided transformer secondary injection, laboratory MMS
  interoperability, education, and reviewable engineering evidence.
